# Disabled on purpose.
#
# This repository deploys an Express backend behind Firebase Hosting rewrites
# to Cloud Run, using environment-specific Firebase configs:
# - firebase.dev.json
# - firebase.prod.json
#
# A Hosting-only PR preview is misleading here because it does not create a
# matching Cloud Run preview revision for backend changes. The active deploy
# flows are:
# - .github/workflows/deploy-dev.yml
# - .github/workflows/deploy-production.yml
#
# If PR previews are needed in the future, implement a Cloud Run-aware preview
# workflow instead of re-enabling this file as-is.
